## Interface: 16001
## Title: Flyout Bars
## Notes: Custom flyout and macro dropdown menu for action bars. One button opens a popup bar of any spell, item, toy, mount or macro, like the mage portal flyout. Put spells, items, toys, mounts and macros in flyouts: portal, teleport, hearthstone or buff menus.
